_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnmuXBv_K24fM4p-GfguQcKvvlF9SNr-9GQ60DjRQtJQ&oe=6AF8AA81"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7J2engHDY0YQ7kNvwEtOn_V&_nc_oc=AdqSfjtEzqDwC5sSLd8-ekEzl4Vr0RLFhX3ZBQoUVsG_MgV3kOSfqWx7rg4GnnsUquw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrIWRGWvFxivQSioJ3eelsPv1UEBlONnQqzfbjPhC2EQ&oe=6AF89F22"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzzlP7RJxgYQ7kNvwHfIojV&_nc_oc=AdrOinSrZduSe3c93FLVg_Ve8fG06Ck_m4JGz-0jo5aK1Z6-fjYna6M5RstK4Ifc7q8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUw_E-3UU3cvV56N-2aZKiLz02LIYA1uhD9C20L4oU2w&oe=6AF8A564"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Uy_JBU3ghAQ7kNvwHeCt7s&_nc_oc=AdpPe-cGCscDuXcAVuxbBJLhM1OkVVVSrdztM_YxqSrk0_H3eewbu4_Lcfab97ZPEIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqUSWYq90nsvnh1VxIYkFD2HYTjt4oX-bhK22ySiGGhQ&oe=6AF8A83C"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gCSBLlpUsicQ7kNvwEq5d52&_nc_oc=Adr2uVq5ln3Ow6Q7RtcSuSVsAeKWIr3RgGQa6Ksuj6Qrf5MUnZXciqKghHEJ8Q5QNnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS6QNBgggKfeozLFhquXeYUvvLFTvJ_-x0zaJDDQjHaOw&oe=6AF8932E"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XD1bHiV1LNMQ7kNvwH7ARx8&_nc_oc=Adrm5MSVPN-YbqYyn1J9JZ2N0UruBfqr9PQwbqoOK1dv_dssl5Bvcl7wFcjRBx8Y3F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbSGyR34c28RNBULoVBYXvIU7dH06qR_mT5GxRJ-hRGw&oe=6AF88CC9"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ook6t3LYK8Q7kNvwH8OPhw&_nc_oc=Adqy0Rfc8V-GH52DdzfSHv3KNJDzGj6i-lM_4zBIkU51sTh5n4IoBxIIQTD845LRoLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7K0mbEXOfe85UXQ7I1HNSM3G6pXpYgeg98bXdJL5n_g&oe=6AF89C96"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=imKRTqYqoAMQ7kNvwFGpX1b&_nc_oc=Adq_wdADljJmA-2bcPJ9_pgk5PkBv-FBASTJa8NIQ1UZSsmOJJHuvfWm6m88CEXSumM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSb2rE8ZFVkCLYQwH7-O2Ni7AI_FxQwWGWLLkWBVyXx1w&oe=6AF88832"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wBFWjK9VeP8Q7kNvwFnKOWf&_nc_oc=AdoMYWPVUkiUKmfCdpk9ZiGM0U_6AHJ-IAnRfFYH1gEMftTjpGzgKiMC4KCcJ_1iMtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFIvaGdHng0O1Oolh2mZHt9_0VULtyiYLJ8m3FYVcaKw&oe=6AF87CE6"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ba6dyO8UwpUQ7kNvwExGDMw&_nc_oc=AdpzMQQD-hkW07-fsSanr8D23TKTpwaDdi1p_odTlloQtpk3WyCxL2NMvb3lVkOhhf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSo2nXuzrBTRwmSij6soEstd-8-liYhG0umh_fJfzAf_Q&oe=6AF880A3"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rIV7skIF9f0Q7kNvwFGrt2L&_nc_oc=Adprx7jp1uYHGuyg0W26P7SQ65ZYK4OsCtM3A5mz_iD69VnDIbCyApB84P9W-S_YVdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9wrqKQ7k6kkTTaKlVjAYEVmzBizNYTiD7oi2ekH-NQQ&oe=6AF8A0E3"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g06nsikehLIQ7kNvwEuuD8O&_nc_oc=AdrIT6D-6X_EVIs47dKiUYD1shYwGGebmms1hPcehMGCq8q3CRb1EQ9luLBGgLskoc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnhKPvdjyFM7glzs5hzxqb3Dw8j0wghEUr1xOncCy02w&oe=6AF8A038"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g